t_mem_i = bwi * vis_lat_w
// bwi = estimated main memory bytes accessed for tile i by worker w

// vis_lat将bytes直接转换为时间，本质为: 
// actual_memory_latency / hiding_factor
// hiding_factor来自OoO/multithreading等latency hiding机制
```

