vis_lat（Visible Latency per Byte）是HotTiles论文引入的data-driven参数，用于capture不同SpMM accelerator worker type的latency hiding能力。它建模了worker对main memory access延迟的有效感知程度：latency hiding能力强的worker（如OoO SPADE PE或multithreading PIUMA MTP）有更低的vis_lat值，因为大量memory access延迟被computation或其他memory access overlap所隐藏。

