```

vis_lat的profiling和拟合流程：
```
// 一次性profiling (仅在HotTiles首次安装时执行)
test_matrices = [small_dense_1, small_sparse_1, ...]  // 小规模测试矩阵
for each worker_type w:
    for each test_matrix m:
        run SpMM with ONLY worker type w (homogeneous mode)
        measure_actual_time[m]  // 实际硬件/模拟器执行时间

    // Search vis_lat_w to minimize prediction error
    best_vis_lat = argmin(sum(
        |predicted_time(m, vis_lat) - measured_actual_time[m]|
        for m in test_matrices
    ))
    store vis_lat_w for future use
```

计算例子（SPADE cold worker for tile with 1000 bytes）：
- t_mem = 1000 bytes × vis_lat_cold
- vis_lat_cold值很小（因OoO hiding大部分latency）→ t_mem接近实际可用BW下的延迟
- 若vis_lat_cold = 0.005 ns/byte, BW=200GB/s → effective BW ≈ 1/0.005 = 200GB/s

